"closed_at":"2025-03-17T15:53:01Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4.stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Nvidia 3070 RTX\n\n### Issue description\n\nSince the 4.4.stable I've got randomly an issue on some preloaded assets, that I declare such as:\n`const CARD_SLOT = preload(\"res://game/systems/deck/card_slot.tscn\")`\n\nThen in the class, I can \n`var my_card = CARD_SLOT.instantiate()`\n\nIn some cases since moving to the new version I've got that issue:\n\n> #Cannot instantiate properly E 0:00:10:355   my_script.gd:13 @ render(): Failed to instantiate scene state of \"\", node count is 0. Make sure the PackedScene resource is valid.\n\nWhen looing In the inspector there is an asset but it's empty:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1073e46c-8dff-400e-9f88-c865a033eca2)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aa1e2499-bea7-4ad0-a493-90b527a4ced1)\n\nIf I use the _ready func and loading the resource there, everything seems to get back to normal.\n`var CARD_SLOT\nCARD_SLOT = load(\"res://game/systems/deck/card_slot.tscn\")`\n\nIt doesn't seem to be broken everywhere I use const XXX = preload(\"xxx.tscn\"). A same resource can be OK in a scene and not in another one. (which was ok in 4.3)\n\nSo I'm a bit confused. I've checked the resources to instantiate and nothing seems to be wrong.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe issue is quite random, I'll check to make a MRP.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"nicolasdelbaer","id":670892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg5Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/670892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolasdelbaer","html_url":"https://github.com/nicolasdelbaer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolasdelbaer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolasdelbaer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolasdelbaer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolasdelbaer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolasdelbaer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolasdelbaer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolasdelbaer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolasdelbaer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolasdelbaer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104270/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104270/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}